        en: { name: 'Sanguich de Miami', description: 'A small sandwich shop on Calle Ocho making Cuban sandwiches to the traditional recipe: crisp bread, roast pork, ham and Swiss cheese.', tip: 'Order the classic Cubano or the pan con lechón and a colada coffee. The counter runs until 8 pm on weekdays, and lunch is best before 12:30. Pay by card.' },
